	(text "Reference: DAC53401 (I2C 0x48) and the VDDQ-derived power-up default"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "03e77b8a-8cab-50f3-bbd3-bf2a56edf5a5")
	)
	(text "RDQS: 150 R load per leg, no series part; host pair DQS6 (fingers 219 / 221) inverted (RDQS_P on its N pin)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "09fe5308-c639-574c-985a-3953e5bbdbc3")
	)
	(text "Without a series resistor the open FPGA end rings for 1 .. 2 ns after an edge:\n0.54 V / -0.12 V at worst (strong driver), 0.45 V / -0.06 V nominal; the pin allows\n-0.20 .. 1.40 V. Damping, if wanted: MR3 drive strength 48 / 60 ohm (gateware)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 143.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a4855a8-b076-5960-adce-43928496ab3f")
	)
	(text "N fingers: 39 R into VREF_RD, 100 nF to GND at each resistor"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e9877d1-8211-50b7-97f4-8e14ec18462b")
	)
	(text "LPDDR5 DQ0-7 -> divider node (sheet Write) -> ZCU104 bank 66 P pins, no series part; every N pin sits on VREF_RD (pseudo-differential). RDQS is a true differential pair."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 21.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31b4237c-bede-50e2-80cb-734f501158d2")
	)
	(text "VREF_RD network:  DAC_OUT -300R- VREF_RD; VDDQ -300R- VREF_RD; VREF_RD -180R- GND; 1 uF + 8 x 100 nF on the bus\n  DAC output Hi-Z (factory default):  0.187 V, 112 ohm source: reads work before any I2C traffic\n  DAC active:  V = 0.2727 x Vdac + 0.1363 V  (0.136 .. 0.631 V, 0.48 mV / LSB, code 121 = 0.195 V)\n  keep VREF_RD at or below 0.20 V if the measured read high level is above 0.42 V (VICM <= 330 mV)\n\nRead levels (150 R shunt on sheet Write is the only DC load; no series resistor):\n  read high 0.374 / 0.386 / 0.405 V  (JEDEC bound 0.362 .. 0.431 V),  reference 0.195 V\n  receiver: IBUFDS_DPHY, IOSTANDARD MIPI_DPHY_DCI, DIFF_TERM = FALSE; read pins are inputs only\n  each N line ends in 39 R = the host line impedance, AC-grounded by 100 nF\n\nRDQS_P / RDQS_N:  VID 0.386 V, VICM 0.193 V while the DRAM drives; both legs 0 V otherwise:\n  gate the receiver output with the read-enable window.\nDQ0-7 read paths are delay matched ball to FPGA die pad within +/-1 ps (In3 bundle)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44cc96d3-b3f9-526e-82dc-9fd0ebaab35f")
	)
